<template><div><h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Open the upstairs route and prepare</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-haus-open" data-guide-step>Buy the stair route and keep enough Jolts for box access and armour. The random Blitz machine gives a random perk; budget for repeated purchases if searching for a particular one. Confirm whether you are playing ordinary Groesten Haus or the separate Prologue challenge edition.</li></ol></section>
